'''Pad Five''' was the fifth landing pad at the [[Imperial Center of Military Research]] on [[Scarif]]. During the [[Battle of Scarif]], [[Bodhi Rook]] ordered [[Corporal]] [[Stordan Tonc]] to create confusion by falsely reporting to the [[Citadel Tower]] that Pad Five had been overtaken by Rebels. As a result, reinforcements were sent to Pad Five.<ref name="Rogue One" />

